        /// <summary>
        /// Select keys
        /// </summary>
        /// <remarks>
        /// Returns all key IDs for specified filter values. This way, you can apply the same filter as in the translation view and get the resulting key IDs for future use.
        /// </remarks>
        /// <param name="filterState">Translation state in the format: languageTag,state. You can use this parameter multiple times.
        /// <br/>
        /// <br/>When used with multiple states for same language it is applied with logical OR. 
